  "description": "A plate from an old reference book: fine, even pen lines on ivory paper, shapes shaded with close cross-hatching, a classic book serif throughout, labels on thin leader lines, one Prussian blue for what matters, slow even motion and a quiet fade between plates, with captions set like a figure caption. Suits anatomy, botany, zoology, geology, instruments and anything best seen as a labelled drawing.",
